SUMMARY:Naftiki Vradia (Naval Night) of Dekapentavgoustos\, Limni
LOCATION:Limni\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Limni\, an old shipowners' town\, marks the evening of 15 August with a naval night on the harbour: decorated boats\, Bengal lights and flares over the bay\, and music on the quay. Part of the municipal summer programme\; the waterfront is packed\, so come by 8 pm for a table.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#limni-naftiki-vradia-naval-night-of-dekapentavgoustos-limni
